      "updated": 1785871297348,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "const pendingPosts: Post[] = []\n\nfunction onPostCreated(post: Post) {\n    pendingPosts.push(post);\n}\n\nfunction applyPendingPosts() {\n    setPosts((current) => [...pendingPosts, ...current]);\n    pendingPosts.length = 0;\n    window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \"smooth\" });\n} \n\nsse, websocket\n\nsse 적용\n-> 카운터 갱신, 새로운 글 배너 \n자동 재연결 스펙 반영\nLast-Event-ID ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "const pendingPosts: Post[] = []\n\nfunction onPostCreated(post: Post) {\n    pendingPosts.push(post);\n}\n\nfunction applyPendingPosts() {\n    setPosts((current) => [...pendingPosts, ...current]);\n    pendingPosts.length = 0;\n    window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \"smooth\" });\n} \n\nsse, websocket\n\nsse 적용\n-> 카운터 갱신, 새로운 글 배너 \n자동 재연결 스펙 반영\nLast-Event-ID ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
